  message: "WORK DONE 2026-10-03 (concurrent run stage 2, NOT merged, no status change). Branch jgstern-agent/fix/mujod (worktree ~/hg_wt/mujod), commits 17c73ebb84 (step 1: go rows keyed by import path -- go.yaml path/filepath; overlay golang.org/x/sys/unix x5 and google.golang.org/grpc), e4af85ab0e (step 2: _module_matches arm 3 requires the ROW to be the longer side; hint_is_path=True restores the other direction for taint's path-derived resolved-edge gate only; named_lookup_arm never passes it, so io and taint agree), c07a5ca605 (scope-gate go line now path/filepath; WI-surar's `HTTP` overlay pin moved to inconclusive). Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/mujod.md.\nEVIDENCE: test_module_slot_hint_longer_suffix.py (10 + 14 red before, green after; koel shape on real TS analyzer output; taint match_sink). Affected smart-test on c07a5ca605: 18148 passed, 0 failed, changed files 100% covered.\nCORPUS A/B by call site, 39 repos / 15 languages (base tree vs branch, every arm prints its tree): hint-longer-only matches on base = koel @/services/http 41, filepath 28, x/sys/unix 19, sys/time 11, grpc 8, nothing else. Branch: koel 41 false net_send gone; go 55 sites (argo-cd 24, runc 20, coredns 10, alertmanager 1) change primitive NAME only, 0 boundaries lost; powerdns 6 time() sites in files including only <sys/time.h> become unclassified (withhold, not confirm); 0 diffs in the other 34 repos. NOT measured: taint verdict movement on a real repo (koel and modsecurity are withheld by the uncatalogued-language gate in both arms)."  # b40c
